title: Curtain Call
text: WHITE light is red, green and blue together. A white target is only happy when all three reach it at once. Bring every stage light down on the star of the show.
trick: three primaries meet on one target to make white
motif: a lighting rig of three lasers whose beams fan down onto a stage
---
% the rig
L 2 1 4 g
L 7 1 4 r
L 12 1 4 b
*B 2 5 4 k
*B 12 5 1 k
% the star
T 7 10 0 ?
% the stage
# 3 12 0 k
# 4 12 0 k
# 5 12 0 k
# 6 12 0 k
# 7 12 0 k
# 8 12 0 k
# 9 12 0 k
# 10 12 0 k
# 11 12 0 k
